        <li>Develop a standardized "Inclusive Atlantis Index" to measure community readiness and progress toward inclusive living.</li>
        <li>Train a network of "Inclusive Constables" – community ambassadors who serve as champions of inclusion, providing education, advocacy, and support to individuals and organizations.</li>
        <li>Launch a digital platform (the "Atlantis Portal") that aggregates accessible resources, real-time accessibility data, and peer support networks.</li>
